==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/EP5|Episode 5]]===
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone30.mp3}} "[[Fade]] says you spoke to [[REALM]]. So this guy's a man on the run, a thief? Huh. The universe never makes it easy! And now these REALM people wanna shut you out, huh?! "Stay out of our business", they said that, as if they gonna tell you what to do. I like making friends, but not this time! We gotta find this fugitive before they do. We wanna know what [[VALORANT Legion|Legion]] is up to, he's the key!"
*{{AC|file=Research Wing Recording Complete.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription between Astra and [[Harbor]], see [[Range/Lore/EP5#Cypher's_Office_2|Range/Lore/EP5 → v5.08 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone35.mp3}} "[[Brimstone]], I didn't know before, but now I'm sure. This is the one, it has to be! Every mention of the artifact is a match! And if this runaway can use it? Game changer! So we must hurry, chale. Our water boy is out of time. [[REALM]] is too close, they're gonna get him! They cannot. It has to be us!"
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone40.mp3}} "Brimstone, can you hear this? Hope so, sending comms from the other side is not easy. We made it out of [[Pearl|Portugal]] but they are on us! These [[Atlas]] fools are all over the place. We split up, I drew them away from [[Skye]] and [[Harbor|Water Boy]], we'll work through Europe, then regroup. No sign of [[Legion]] yet, could be very good or very bad. But we'll make it, I promise you! Just wish us luck, okay? Okay."
*{{AC|file=Skye Audio Log Omega Mission Complete.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription between Astra, [[Harbor]], [[Skye]] and Atlas troops, see [[Range/Lore/EP5#Cypher's_Office_4|Range/Lore/EP5 → v5.12 → Cypher's Office]].)''

===[[Range/Lore/EP7|Episode 7]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone62.mp3}} "Boss. Where are you? Come on now, the food's ready and the fam's all here! You know they're not going to wait for you and they're not gonna save you a plate. Team potluck dinner and you're the last one I gotta track down, are you serious?! The world won't die tonight. So, put down those reports and move!"

===[[Range/Lore/EP8|Episode 8]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone79.mp3}} "Hey boss, I spoke with our [[Clove|new friend]]. Wanted to know more about, uh, where they go when their soul takes a break. Nothing like the [[Astral Form|astral plane-o]]. I checked our database and got my small collection of [[Guardians|Guardian]] records there. As far as I can tell, immortality is not rare in [[radiants]], it is unprecedented! Hm. They worry me. That their power, it's a blessing now, but later? Chale... I'm not so sure."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone82.mp3}} ''(This voicemail was left by both Harbor and Astra at the same time.)''
**[[File:Harbor icon.png|25px|link=Harbor]]: "Brimstone, Astra and I are over at the α-[[Lotus]] site, or should I say what's left of it. We wanted to come back and see if there was any pertinent information here now that we know a little about this [[Scions of Hourglass]] group. Suffice to say, while the [[Omega]] site is still bristling with [[radianite]] signatures, this place has been scrubbed clean. We've also been- oh-... yeah yeah yeah... one moment..."
**[[File:Astra icon.png|25px|link=Astra]]: "Hey, Water Boy! Hand me the phone! Brim, Harbor gave you the deets, hm? Look, Hourglass kills scientists instead of kidnapping them and they tried to leave no witnesses to that journal, huh? And now this with the Nexus?! This is about erasing information, keeping it from the public! That place the journal describes? It will show us how deep this goes! Of this I am certain!"

